---
interface Props {
  lang: 'ar' | 'en';
}

const { lang } = Astro.props;
---

<figure class="diagram-figure" aria-label={lang === 'ar' ? 'مخطط شبكات توصيل المحتوى CDN ومسار إصابة الكاش مقابل الخادم الأصلي' : 'CDN edge caching: Cache hit vs Origin fetch traversal'}>
  <div class="diagram-header">
    <span class="diagram-tag">
      {lang === 'ar' ? 'مخطط 06 / توصيل المحتوى' : 'DIAGRAM 06 / CONTENT DELIVERY'}
    </span>
    <span>
      {lang === 'ar' ? 'شبكات الحافة (CDN): استرجاع الكاش مقابل جلب الأصل' : 'Edge Distribution (CDN): Edge Cache Hit vs. Origin Fetch'}
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="diagram-svg-container">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 820 280" width="100%" height="auto" style="min-width: 640px; display: block;" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="cdn-hatch" width="6" height="6" patternTransform="rotate(45 0 0)" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="6" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-opacity="0.12" />
        </pattern>
        <pattern id="cdn-olive-hatch" width="6" height="6" patternTransform="rotate(45 0 0)" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="6" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-opacity="0.25" />
        </pattern>
        <marker id="cdn-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z" fill="#151515" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="cdn-arrow-olive" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z" fill="#5F6849" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- Frame -->
      <rect x="8" y="8" width="804" height="264" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.25" />
      <line x1="8" y1="24" x2="8" y2="8" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="2" />
      <line x1="8" y1="8" x2="24" y2="8" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="2" />
      <line x1="812" y1="256" x2="812" y2="272" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="2" />
      <line x1="812" y1="272" x2="796" y2="272" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="2" />

      <!-- Step 1: Client Host -->
      <g transform="translate(25, 35)">
        <rect width="145" height="195" fill="#F4F1E9" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.4" />
        <rect width="145" height="24" fill="#EBE7DE" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="12" y="16" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8" font-weight="700" fill="#151515">01 / CLIENT BROWSER</text>
        <text x="12" y="48" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">HTTP REQUEST</text>
        <line x1="12" y1="55" x2="133" y2="55" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-opacity="0.25" />
        <text x="12" y="74" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="#5F5D56">GET /index.html</text>
        <text x="12" y="88" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="#5F5D56">Host: example.com</text>
        <rect x="10" y="105" width="125" height="50" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.8" />
        <text x="16" y="122" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5" fill="#151515">Direct to Origin (No CDN)</text>
        <text x="16" y="136" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="#5F5D56">— OR —</text>
        <text x="16" y="148" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5" fill="#5F6849">Via Anycast Edge PoP</text>
      </g>

      <!-- Arrow 1 -> 2 -->
      <path d="M 170 100 L 225 100" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#cdn-arrow)" />

      <!-- Step 2: CDN Edge Node (Centerpiece) -->
      <g transform="translate(230, 35)">
        <rect width="280" height="195" fill="#F4F1E9" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1.6" />
        <rect width="280" height="24" fill="#EBE7DE" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="14" y="16" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700" fill="#5F6849">02 / CDN EDGE POP (GEOGRAPHICALLY CLOSE)</text>

        <!-- Path A: Cache Hit -->
        <rect x="14" y="38" width="252" height="62" fill="url(#cdn-olive-hatch)" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="24" y="54" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8" font-weight="700" fill="#5F6849">PATH A: CACHE HIT (CF-Cache-Status: HIT)</text>
        <text x="24" y="68" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5" fill="#151515">Static assets (CSS, JS, WebP, cached HTML) served</text>
        <text x="24" y="82" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="#5F6849">from Edge RAM/SSD without touching Origin. (5-15ms)</text>

        <!-- Return Arrow for Cache Hit -->
        <path d="M 230 70 L 170 70" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 3" marker-end="url(#cdn-arrow-olive)" />

        <!-- Path B: Cache Miss -->
        <rect x="14" y="112" width="252" height="68" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="24" y="128" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8" font-weight="700" fill="#151515">PATH B: CACHE MISS / DYNAMIC ROUTE</text>
        <text x="24" y="142" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5" fill="#5F5D56">Uncached HTML or personalized API request.</text>
        <text x="24" y="156" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="#151515">Header: CF-Cache-Status: MISS / DYNAMIC</text>
        <text x="24" y="170" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="#8F2D2D">Edge initiates upstream request to Origin.</text>
      </g>

      <!-- Arrow 2 -> 3 (Origin fetch) -->
      <path d="M 510 150 L 565 150" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#cdn-arrow)" />

      <!-- Step 3: Origin Server -->
      <g transform="translate(570, 35)">
        <rect width="225" height="195" fill="#F4F1E9" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.4" />
        <rect width="225" height="24" fill="#EBE7DE" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="12" y="16" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700" fill="#151515">03 / ORIGIN SERVER</text>
        <text x="12" y="48" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">PRIMARY BACKEND</text>
        <line x1="12" y1="55" x2="213" y2="55" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-opacity="0.25" />
        
        <rect x="10" y="66" width="205" height="52" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.8" />
        <text x="18" y="82" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="#151515">Web Application Server</text>
        <text x="18" y="96" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="#5F5D56">Nginx / Node / Go / Python</text>
        <text x="18" y="110" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5" fill="#5F5D56">Database queries &amp; SSR</text>

        <!-- Origin response back to edge -->
        <path d="M 570 175 L 510 175" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="3 3" marker-end="url(#cdn-arrow-olive)" />
        <text x="18" y="142" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="#5F6849">Origin returns response</text>
        <text x="18" y="156" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7" fill="#5F5D56">Edge caches if cacheable,</text>
        <text x="18" y="168" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7" fill="#5F5D56">then returns to client.</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="diagram-caption">
    {lang === 'ar'
      ? 'الشكل 06: شبكات الحافة (CDN) — في حال وجود المورد في كاش الحافة (Cache Hit) يُعاد للعميل فورًا دون الاتصال بالخادم الأصلي. في حال الـMiss يُجلب المورد من السيرفر الرئيسي.'
      : 'Figure 06: Content Delivery Networks (CDN) — a Cache Hit serves content directly from the edge PoP near the client, whereas a Cache Miss requires an upstream trip to the Origin server.'}
  </figcaption>
</figure>
